---
/** Type specimens: the three families, the scale, the measure. */
---

<div class="page sg-type">
  <p class="state">
    <span class="kick">Archivo, 17 px interface, display up to 56 px</span>Writing about photography, software, and{" "}
    <em>the places in between.</em>
  </p>
  <p class="lede">
    Source Serif (PG Serif) for reading: 18 to 20 px, line height 1.65, about 66 characters to the line.
  </p>
  <p class="mono">JetBrains Mono for metadata only · 2026-10-21 · No. 042 · IT→EN · f/8 · 1/250 s · ISO 200</p>
  <p class="up">Uppercase label, 12 px, tracked</p>
  <p class="small muted">Small muted interface text, 14 px.</p>
  <p class="sg-note">
    Hover, focus and pressed states are drawn from the same tokens; nothing animates when the visitor asks for reduced
    motion.
  </p>
</div>
